Package: RBhikam
Title: Tools for Cleaning Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Rajdai", "Bhikam", email = "rajdaib@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: RBhikam package is for beginner users of R studio. This package is designed to help 
    users clean, summarize and Visualize data. It will help the user with processing simple functions 
    like renaming columns and removing missing values,and just organizating the data which will make 
    it easy for analysis and reporting.  
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports:  dplyr, ggplot2, stats, rlang
License: CC0
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
